WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.504 --> 00:00:11.160
Hello! Welcome to Cosmogeek Solutions. In this video we will explain our Mobile App Development service.

2
00:00:11.448 --> 00:00:23.616
Your customers and field teams spend most of their day on their phones. A good mobile app puts your service directly in their hands.

3
00:00:23.904 --> 00:00:35.040
We build Android and iOS apps, usually from a single Flutter or React Native codebase, with a secure backend and admin panel.

4
00:00:35.736 --> 00:00:42.048
First, let us understand the problems that commonly come up with mobile apps.

5
00:00:42.336 --> 00:00:49.632
One, the app experience is inconsistent across different Android and iOS devices.

6
00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:57.744
Two, data is lost in the field when the internet is weak, because the app does not work offline.

7
00:00:58.032 --> 00:01:04.104
Three, heavy lag when uploading photos or tracking live location.

8
00:01:04.392 --> 00:01:11.952
And four, Play Store and App Store guidelines and release processes are quite complex.

9
00:01:12.648 --> 00:01:17.544
Now let us see what our service includes.

10
00:01:17.832 --> 00:01:26.352
Android and iOS apps: cross-platform development, with native modules when needed.

11
00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:34.368
Touch-first UX: simple screens that are comfortable to use with one hand.

12
00:01:34.656 --> 00:01:44.448
Offline sync: work continues without internet, and data syncs automatically when the connection returns.

13
00:01:44.736 --> 00:01:50.136
Push notifications, GPS tracking and maps integration.

14
00:01:50.424 --> 00:01:57.456
Secure access with OTP and biometric login, plus payment gateway integration.

15
00:01:57.744 --> 00:02:05.376
And a web admin panel with backend APIs, so you can manage all of the app's data.

16
00:02:06.072 --> 00:02:16.176
Here is an example. This is the home screen of an ordering app, where customers browse products and order directly.

17
00:02:16.464 --> 00:02:23.664
As soon as an order is confirmed, a push notification arrives, so the customer gets every update instantly.

18
00:02:23.952 --> 00:02:29.568
During delivery, live tracking appears on the map in real time.

19
00:02:29.856 --> 00:02:37.440
And if the network drops, the app saves data offline and syncs it later.

20
00:02:38.136 --> 00:02:41.880
Now, our process, step by step.

21
00:02:42.168 --> 00:02:51.336
Step one, requirements and prototype. We define user roles and flows and build a clickable prototype.

22
00:02:51.624 --> 00:02:56.904
Step two, touch-first UI design for both platforms.

23
00:02:57.192 --> 00:03:07.536
Step three, developing the app screens, APIs and admin panel in milestones, so you get a test build at every stage.

24
00:03:07.824 --> 00:03:13.008
Step four, testing on many real phones and OS versions.

25
00:03:13.296 --> 00:03:20.544
And step five, release on the Play Store and App Store, followed by updates and support.

26
00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:29.136
We use proven technologies such as Flutter, React Native, Swift and Node.js.

27
00:03:29.424 --> 00:03:39.432
With a cross-platform approach, one codebase runs on both platforms, making development and maintenance easier.

28
00:03:40.128 --> 00:03:43.632
What does your business gain?

29
00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:51.216
A direct channel to customers. Notifications keep bringing them back.

30
00:03:51.504 --> 00:03:57.336
Two platforms from one codebase, meaning less effort and less maintenance.

31
00:03:57.624 --> 00:04:03.408
Reliable in the field, because the app is built offline-first.

32
00:04:03.696 --> 00:04:09.072
And we manage everything from store release to updates.

33
00:04:09.768 --> 00:04:22.176
Who uses these apps? Ordering and delivery apps, field staff and contractor apps, booking apps, loyalty apps and internal team apps.

34
00:04:22.464 --> 00:04:33.624
In industries like food delivery, agriculture, construction, retail, healthcare and logistics, these apps make daily work easier.

35
00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:45.000
If you have an app idea, or want an app for your business, talk to Cosmogeek Solutions.

36
00:04:45.288 --> 00:04:52.704
We have been building digital solutions for businesses from Wardha, Maharashtra, since 2019.

37
00:04:52.992 --> 00:05:00.456
Click Start a Project, or call or WhatsApp us. Thank you!
